<view class="page">
  <view class="hero"><text class="title">同题复练</text><text>每轮单独记录。开始、上传与核对不等于上交；复练不改首答、正式成绩或独立掌握证据。</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" aria-role="alert">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="card">{{notice}}</view>
  <button bindtap="load" disabled="{{busy}}">重新核对当前学校记录</button>
  <view wx:if="{{target}}" class="card"><text>从原结果选择的确切题目和讲评版本。开始时仍由服务器核验，不会自动绑定新版。</text><button bindtap="start" type="primary" disabled="{{busy || pending}}">明确开始一轮独立复练</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{pending}}" class="card"><text>开始结果待确认 · {{pending.operationId}}</text><button bindtap="recover" disabled="{{busy}}">查询原开始回执</button><button bindtap="retry" disabled="{{busy}}">明确重试原请求</button><button bindtap="abandon" disabled="{{busy}}">核对后关闭本机追踪</button></view>
  <view class="card" wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="id"><text class="heading">{{item.started}}</text><text>{{item.submitted ? '已上交的独立副本' : '已开始，尚未上交'}}</text><button bindtap="open" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{busy}}">{{item.submitted ? '打开本轮上交与当前参考反馈' : '继续本轮复练'}}</button></view>
  <text wx:if="{{!busy && total === 0}}">当前范围没有复练记录。</text><text>可查看轮次：{{total}}</text><view class="pager"><button bindtap="page" data-direction="-1" disabled="{{busy || offset === 0}}">上一页</button><button bindtap="page" data-direction="1" disabled="{{busy || offset + 20 >= total}}">下一页</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{pendingTotal}}" class="card"><text class="heading">当前学校待确认的开始操作（{{pendingTotal}}）</text><button wx:for="{{pendingStarts}}" wx:key="id" bindtap="manage" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{busy}}">核对 {{item.id}}</button><view class="pager"><button bindtap="page" data-kind="pending" data-direction="-1" disabled="{{busy || pendingOffset === 0}}">上一页</button><button bindtap="page" data-kind="pending" data-direction="1" disabled="{{busy || pendingOffset + 20 >= pendingTotal}}">下一页</button></view></view>
</view>
